WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.070
Three traps catch Grade 10s every year.

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:06.460
Here they are, so they don't catch you.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.610
One: no direction.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:14.440
Momentum, change in momentum, impulse and force all need a direction,

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.570
or a sign with your positive direction stated.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.070
Two: the bounce.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.200
If it comes back, the two velocities have opposite signs.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:28.760
Final minus initial: minus 8 minus 12, not 8 minus 12.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:30.890
Three: the airbag.

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:34.260
The change in momentum does not get smaller.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:37.730
The time gets longer, so the force gets smaller.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.640
And a bonus: milliseconds.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.000
20 milliseconds is 0,020 seconds.

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:45.850
Convert before you divide.
